      "widgets_values": [
        "EmpirioLabs AI: image to video\n\nGenerate Image creates the first frame. Its url output links to the image, and Generate Video animates it. To make a video from text only, disconnect image_url. Video generation usually takes 1 to 15 minutes. Each image and video uses credits from your EmpirioLabs AI account.\n\nAdd your API key before you run this workflow: set the EMPIRIOLABS_API_KEY environment variable and restart ComfyUI, or copy config.example.ini to config.ini in the EmpirioLabs AI node folder and paste your key there. Do not type the key into a node, because workflows and saved images keep node values.\n\nCreate a key at https://platform.empiriolabs.ai/dashboard/api-keys\nModels and prices: https://empiriolabs.ai/models"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "EmpirioLabs AI: image to video\n\nGenerate Image creates the first frame. Its url output links to the image, and Generate Video animates it. To make a video from text only, disconnect image_url. Video generation usually takes 1 to 15 minutes. Each image and video uses credits from your EmpirioLabs AI account.\n\nAdd your API key before you run this workflow: set the EMPIRIOLABS_API_KEY environment variable and restart ComfyUI, or copy config.example.ini to config.ini in the EmpirioLabs AI node folder and paste your key there. Do not type the key into a node, because workflows and saved images keep node values.\n\nCreate a key at https://platform.empiriolabs.ai/dashboard/api-keys\nModels and prices: https://empiriolabs.ai/models"
